        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gichea eehoosanda ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega orjoogiyya gagasa ea maduuleana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ginung'waadi gideaba gajahiimsiina rabasta inyeanda jeeda aba gideaba gwanda fuga mwaatkwa niing'aata malaykajeega nea mwanala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oapkaada fuga Mida ghealooniga, ak goowuurjeewi giloondeayeesi ghealooniga sea saawa. Oapkaada fugiga sisawaniin, aba gideaba eara agooga goondeawi sasanuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeshooda dasisiina mureeda buuneesean, nea eara bulaliida gagasa ea mandeawana ririnnyeanda; aba gideaba ASEETA gaygoorgweaksa fuga munyas ea gea mealuuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giheeleewi eaweagaagu bariinyeega lapiya, ak gagasa ghoahiinyi gida indeawi aba gideaba gwayi, “Aniini manda gichea daraay ghana danung'useey heeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean abeeda gajeamuusa eerukuna nea geesikteawi gideaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oapkaada fuga ahaaghwaneegwa, fugiga rukuneegwa ng'asheanda ASEETEAN; asikteawana gichea ghabwat geeshta eaweega nyaawa, ak googali masaweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu Gristo gawuurji gideaba heeta ea ghamneawa ea gagul damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoayaachi geeshta ng'asheega saang'a ea giinealshajeega hidu; aba gideaba ghwahit geemajeek guroorooda aba dagheerjeanduumeeda, nea mii aba hamichoojiga gil, ak ea mwanyagaada aba gidaat geeshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geendeawi heeda wagiida nea fugiga gadiiyi aba jeeda maheemajeandean ea madoobiiwsiina gideaba gayghwaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba sasanuuka diyeanga siihiida foojeanyeeka nyaawa ak ghwaat ashoohoocheanda haw heeda ghaydit ghoah lukghumeeda aba badayda riing'eedean geaghwarda aba jarooda murdeeda gambiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara Yesu gwasawana aba madeetooshta ak abeeda ghoamiidu buuneeda aba foojeandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eeweaya mwadi heeda mida aba jarooda was murdeeda gambiini, ak geeguuyeesi baspaseegaaschi ghayi ahang'waay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aba hiji meendeawani mujiineeda jea ghwashng'u, aseasa geegasayi mujiineeda jea ghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aba niny eegala mwadi nea geataydi lukghumeeda duumsheesiinda ASEETA, nea haghweega ghuuta gil gea mwas gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoofooli sinooda ng'asheega miyaasiin nea goobareanyi haleanjeeda oondeawi, aba gideaba lukghumeeda sunu goohoosan ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asisiina mureeda fuga ahaaghwaneegwa nea googadiyeesi; aba gideaba saawa gang'ula gurooruunatkeagwa, nea gawuurji siida jea goodayiida ng'asheega. Asi saawa gagasa gwasin ng'asheesu nea gahoosan, nea adagagiisan, aba gideaba ng'asheega sunu maygwarachi gil aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwaasha ASEETA ghawooda aba badahuukaasa, aba gideaba geesikteawi gideaba geendeawi fughareeda miy, nea geegasayi eesina haleanjeeda sean aba mureeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geamuscheegwa muuchi aba jeedeanyu asina ng'asheanji ak abeeda geebay eeteelnean heedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mooshta ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ASEETA mideawa hoyyoo biikta gweadu gicha Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu aba jeeda miyeeda, jeagiischoocheanda haw bea gisilga, aba foojeanda neajeeda manda muudeanooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gagasa gagooneegwa haleanjeeda sean miyaasiin ak abeeda goosinyi gidagasa, nea gagadiiy aba jeedeang'wa gidagasa niny aba gheanyangaaschi aba naweeda Yesu Gristo; nea giigheambiita ea daanyi damanda manda muudeanooda. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuscheegwa, fuga eaduupcheewi, oang'waanya ng'asheandeanyu jea goomajeegeegwa, aba gideaba ng'asheesu geang'oorneegwa nea ghaanuwaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anala gideaba orjeeda giyeanya was Dimoteo siitin aba ghealooniga, ak abeeda gaydabay dahidu heedeang'wa iibay ghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghada fugeagwa hees ea fuga ghaydidi sean. Fugiga leabu ng'eanyiida Italiya ghoaghadeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anyasa oogasean dagheerjeanduumeeda. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
